{
  "body_human_readable": "## Weather in Kyiv: Sunny Skies with a High of 14\u00b0C\n\nKyiv is currently experiencing a sunny day with a temperature of 14\u00b0C (58\u00b0F). The real feel temperature is slightly cooler at 13\u00b0C (55\u00b0F).\n\nThe humidity is at 68%, and there is currently no chance of rain. The forecast for tonight indicates a possibility of light rain.\n\nLooking ahead, the weather is expected to be variable with periods of light rain and partly cloudy skies over the next few days. Temperatures are forecasted to range between 6\u00b0C and 11\u00b0C.",
